OL,3,AOne man dead and two missing as search
OL,4,Agoes on for fishing boat off Lewis
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a body has been found in the
OL,7,Fsearch for three men who were onboard a
OL,8,Ffishing boat that has gone missing off
OL,9,Fthe Western Isles.
OL,11,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,12,F(MCA) said the alarm was raised at
OL,13,Fabout 21:20 on Tuesday when it emerged
OL,14,Fthe boat was overdue from Lewis.
OL,16,FIt said a plane and two helicopters
OL,17,Fwere making searches off the Port of
OL,18,FNess in north Lewis.
OL,20,FSix coastguard rescue teams, two RNLI
OL,21,Flifeboats, a local boat and Police
OL,22,FScotland have also been involved.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
